WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.117
Which way in is yours? Five answers decide.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:10.783
Outrun Extinction is an imaginary charity run for cheetahs. Five quick questions find your way in.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.617
The rows below follow the answer, and you can still press another way in.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.333
Register opens the mock campaign’s twelve cities and dates, across four nations.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.950
Nothing leaves the browser: no cookie, no analytics, no server.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.167
Two campaigns share one build, and accessibility checks must pass before each deploy.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:49.150
Answer the five questions yourself, at outrun.junaid.guru.
